{"ID":"20251104155024-59z5w43","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251104155024-59z5w43","title":"UPL9-1——GPU Skinning","type":"doc","updated":"20251104160244"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155024-xo2a2oz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251104155024-xo2a2oz","updated":"20251104155753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Skinning"}]},{"ID":"20251104155229-l5pajkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155229-l5pajkp","updated":"20251104155251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Skinning（GPU 蒙皮）是 Unity 中提供给我们的一个功能开关\n可以在 Project Settings ——\u003e Player ——\u003e Other Settings ——\u003e GPU Skinning 中进行设置\n它的设置 决定了 角色动画（带 Skinned Mesh Renderer 蒙皮网格渲染器的对象）里顶点随骨骼运动的变形计算 在 GPU 还是 CPU 中进行"}]},{"ID":"20251104155258-pit5cit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155258-pit5cit","updated":"20251104155613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104155613-04s35f8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251104155631-yxiz4xp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104155631-yxiz4xp","updated":"20251104155753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Skinning 的三种模式"}]},{"ID":"20251104155639-7d29bv2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155639-7d29bv2","updated":"20251104155740"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155645-7isms0v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-7isms0v","updated":"20251104155645"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155645-9xzldop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-9xzldop","updated":"20251104155645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU"}]},{"ID":"20251104155646-i8opb0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155646-i8opb0h","updated":"20251104155701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有蒙皮运算都在 CPU 中完成，完成后，CPU 把最终的顶点位置传给 GPU\n这种方式虽然兼容性好，但是 CPU 压力很大，大量角色存在时可能导致 CPU 成为瓶颈"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104155645-y2equru","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-y2equru","updated":"20251104155645"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155645-qtlyxz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-qtlyxz0","updated":"20251104155645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU"}]},{"ID":"20251104155703-ek9u2ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155703-ek9u2ms","updated":"20251104155724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 只算部分内容，比如骨骼矩阵，顶点变形由 GPU 顶点着色器来做\n这种方式可以大幅减少 CPU 运算和数据传输\nGPU 会对每个模型单独计算蒙皮，如果 DrawCall 较高，会带来一定开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104155645-lm7cniq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-lm7cniq","updated":"20251104155740"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155645-sbqamrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155645-sbqamrb","updated":"20251104155645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU (Batched)"}]},{"ID":"20251104155727-fbd4bg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155727-fbd4bg9","updated":"20251104155740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Skinning 的批处理版本，Unity 会把多个 Skinned Mesh Renderer 的蒙皮运算 合并在一次 GPU Pass 里\n这种方式极大减少 DrawCall 和 API 调用开销，更适合场景中有很多相同或相似角色（比如群怪、士兵大军）的情况\n但是内存使用较高，并且部分低端设备可能不支持"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104155753-kd4kum4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104155753-kd4kum4","updated":"20251104160244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该如何选择"}]},{"ID":"20251104155801-kjq0pql","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155801-kjq0pql","updated":"20251104155843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155817-m3i7vx1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155817-m3i7vx1","updated":"20251104155817"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155817-nm0dmts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155817-nm0dmts","updated":"20251104155817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU:"}]},{"ID":"20251104155819-ehjsdm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155819-ehjsdm2","updated":"20251104155828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当 模型顶点数 * 骨骼数 很大时，CPU 负担会很重\n每帧要传输大量顶点数据到 GPU，对内存带宽消耗也大\n因此仅适合动画使用较少的项目"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104155818-v3biqj2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104155818-v3biqj2","updated":"20251104155843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104155818-xhipyfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155818-xhipyfu","updated":"20251104155832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 和 GPU (Batched)："}]},{"ID":"20251104155834-hgh89uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155834-hgh89uh","updated":"20251104155843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过使用这种模式可以有效减少 CPU 负担\n减少 CPU 到 GPU 的数据传输量，特别适合有 大量角色 或 高顶点数模型 的场景"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104155801-vvmb6rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104155801-vvmb6rb","updated":"20251104160244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果目标设备性能中高，优先选 GPU (Batched)\n如果目标是低端移动设备，角色数不多，GPU 更稳，兼容性更好\n只有在 GPU 端顶点计算已经成为瓶颈时，才考虑回退到 CPU 或优化模型和骨骼（甚至不考虑回退，直接从优化 GPU 入手）"}]}]}